          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "శిథిలాలు — śithilālu — \"ruins\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "అడవిలో పాత కోట శిథిలాలు ఉన్నాయి. aḍavilō pāta kōṭa śithilālu unnāyi. There are ruins of an old fort in the forest."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A plural noun; శిథిల, loose or decayed, makes the adjective."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "శిథిలాలు (śithilālu) is built on Sanskrit śithila, \"loose, slack\" (Monier-Williams): what has come loose and fallen."
            }
